   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Reading conditions and asking tactfully",
     "texto": [
      "In an advert, distinguish **leiepris** (rent), **depositum** (deposit) and **felleskostnader** (shared costs). Don't assume that services such as internet are included if they aren't specified.",
      "The conditional **kunne** softens a request: **Kunne jeg få vite om strøm er inkludert?** («Could I find out whether electricity is included?»). **Eventuelt** introduces a possible eventuality; it doesn't always equal English «eventually»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
